    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">A token moves inside a hallway containing positions <const>0</const> to <var>n</var>-<const>1</const>.<br><br>It starts at position <var>p</var> and initially moves toward larger positions.<br><br>At each step, the token moves exactly <const>1</const> position.<br><br>If the next move would cause the token to leave the hallway, it first reverses direction, then moves.<br><br>Output the position of the token after <var>t</var> steps.</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> An integer <var>n</var> for the number of positions in the hallway.<br><strong>Line 2:</strong> An integer <var>p</var> for the starting position.<br><strong>Line 3:</strong> A long integer <var>t</var> for the number of steps.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\"><strong>Line 1:</strong> The final position of the token.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\">1 &le; <var>n</var> &le; 10^9<br>0 &le; <var>p</var> &lt; <var>n</var><br>0 &le; <var>t</var> &le; 10^9</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">5\n1\n3</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-out\">4</pre>\n         </div>\n      </div>\n   </div>\n</div>"
